Sha Ou received her B.S. degree in Chemistry from Guizhou University in 2011. Currently, she is a doctoral student in chemistry in Zhejiang University under the direction of Professor Chuan-De Wu. Her research is focused on the development of porous N-heterocyclic carbene-based MOFs for heterogeneous catalysis.
